WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.440
Now we will be
injecting the frontalis.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.240
The frontalis is an elevator muscle.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.540
It's a square muscle that
sits on top of the forehead.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.020
I will have the
patient emote and move,

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.440
and you will see the mechanism of
action as the frontalis raises

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.780
up those eyebrows.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.080
We will find our line of convergence,

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.300
and then we will start by
marking our injection points.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:39.020
All of these injection points will
be mid-depth and will be anywhere

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.980
from two to four units.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:51.720
You want to avoid injecting low
on the forehead so the patient

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:56.380
won't feel heavy or get a
low eyebrow or lid ptosis.
